LiveToast 0.11.0: let LiveView own server-event listeners and keep flash-leave
on its element, so destroyed hooks leave no global listeners behind.
Patch source and all shipped JS entrypoints. Drop stale upstream source-map
references so asset builds map the patched JS rather than the original source.
Remove this patch when an upstream release includes the lifecycle fix.

